# Claims Ledger (Audit-Ready)

Purpose: Convert public claims into reproducible, locally verifiable, hash-anchored evidence.

Scope: This ledger covers every quantitative claim stated in README, plus any “validation” statements (e.g., third-party testing).

Legend:
- Status: DRAFT / PARTIAL / VERIFIED / EXTERNAL-REF / BLOCKED
- Evidence Artifact: file(s) inside this repo OR external reference ID + verification procedure
- Reproduce: one-command or minimal steps to reproduce the evidence
- Expected Output: exact numeric target(s) + tolerance
- Hash: SHA-256 of evidence output file(s)

